    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0138","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Lucía Eriksdóttir talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
